<title>UK: Shanks &amp; McEwan H1 profit shows slim rise.</title>
<headline>Shanks &amp; McEwan H1 profit shows slim rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 28, 1996</p>
<p>			    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p>  Shr (pence)		3.9		    vs  3.7</p>
<p>  Dividend (pence)	 1.3		    vs  1.2</p>
<p>  Pretax		    11.6		    vs 10.8</p>
<p>  Turnover		  61.4		    vs 56.9</p>
<p>Note - Shanks &amp; McEwan Group Plc is a waste handling firm.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +0171-542 7717</p>
</text>
